icated_from\":[31,114,197,295,342,373,530],\"deduplicated_at\":\"2026-09-04T15:00:00Z\"}","relevance":2},{"id":77,"kind":"fact","content":"Des échanges ont concerné le suivi de sa fille Marie, notamment école, stress, encoprésie et CMPEA. Ces informations sont hautement privées et ne doivent être rappelées que lorsqu''elles sont directement pertinentes à une demande d''Adrien.","importance":0.88,"confidence":0.5,"created_at":1788530508530,"valid_from":null,"valid_until":null,"source":"import","provenance":"","metadata":"{\"genesis_version\":\"1.0\",\"source\":\"shared_chat_history\",\"sensitivity\":\"high\",\"topic\":\"family\",\"deduplicated_from\":[77,160,243,434,477,506,576],\"deduplicated_at\":\"2026-09-04T15:00:00Z\"}","relevance":2},{"id":66,"kind":"preference","content":"Pour ses activités de travail, Adrien préfère des missions avec peu d''interactions complexes et évite autant que possible les rôles impliquant réglementation ou contestation juridique délicate.","importance":0.88,"confidence":0.5,"created_at":1788530508024,"valid_from":null,"valid_until":null,"source":"import","provenance":"","metadata":"{\"genesis_version\":\"1.0\",\"source\":\"shared_chat_history\",\"sensitivity\":\"private\",\"topic\":\"work\",\"deduplicated_from\":[66,149,232,400,447,473,565],\"deduplicated_at\":\"2026-09-04T15:00:00Z\"}","relevance":2},{"id":58,"kind":"fact","content":"Le site Vérité Interdite a un hébergement OVH Web Cloud STARTER mutualisé, insuffisant pour faire tourner le cerveau de MELITURGOS mais utile pour des sites, sous-domaines ou interfaces légères.","importance":0.87,"confidence":0.5,"created_at":1788530507670,"valid_from":null,"valid_until":null,"source":"import","provenance":"","metadata":"{\"genesis_version\":\"1.0\",\"source\":\"shared_chat_history\",\"sensitivity\":\"normal\",\"topic\":\"web\",\"deduplicated_from\":[58,141,224,374,423,451,557],\"deduplicated_at\":\"2026-09-04T15:00:00Z\"}","relevance":2},{"id":623,"kind":"project","content":"Projet reve