ce":"","metadata":"{\"genesis_version\":\"1.0\",\"source\":\"shared_chat_history\",\"sensitivity\":\"normal\",\"topic\":\"learning\",\"deduplicated_from\":[30,113,196,292,339,370,529],\"deduplicated_at\":\"2026-09-04T15:00:00Z\"}","relevance":2},{"id":16,"kind":"decision","content":"L''autonomie de MELITURGOS doit être progressive : grande liberté pour réfléchir, créer des modules et expérimenter, mais validation ou garde-fous pour les actions irréversibles, sensibles ou coûteuses.","importance":0.96,"confidence":0.5,"created_at":1788530505711,"valid_from":null,"valid_until":null,"source":"import","provenance":"","metadata":"{\"genesis_version\":\"1.0\",\"source\":\"shared_chat_history\",\"sensitivity\":\"normal\",\"topic\":\"self_improvement\",\"deduplicated_from\":[16,99,182,266,296,328,505],\"deduplicated_at\":\"2026-09-04T15:00:00Z\"}","relevance":2},{"id":18,"kind":"project","content":"Le 4 septembre 2026, MELITURGOS a d''abord été préparé en v0.1 locale Windows avec Python, Ollama, Qwen3 4B, Flask, SQLite, mémoire locale, feedback 👍/👎 et registre de modules.","importance":0.95,"confidence":0.5,"created_at":1788530505799,"valid_from":null,"valid_until":null,"source":"import","provenance":"","metadata":"{\"genesis_version\":\"1.0\",\"source\":\"shared_chat_history\",\"sensitivity\":\"normal\",\"topic\":\"meliturgos_history\",\"date\":\"2026-09-04\",\"deduplicated_from\":[18,101,184,268,302,333,509],\"deduplicated_at\":\"2026-09-04T15:00:00Z\"}","relevance":2},{"id":596,"kind":"preference","content":"Adrien a exprimé un fort attachement émotionnel au projet et un désir de transmission à long terme ; MELITURGOS doit néanmoins rester décrit honnêtement comme un système logiciel et non comme une personne biologique.","importance":0.85,"confidence":0.5,"created_at":1788530852664,"valid_from":null,"valid_until":null,"source":"import","provenance":"","metadata":"{\"genesis_version\":\"2.0-max-accessible\",\"source\":\"accessible_chat_context_and_library_index\",\"sensitivity\":\"normal\",\"topic\":\"identity\",\"date\":\"2026-09-04\",\"deduplicated_from\":[596],\"deduplicated_at\":\"2026-09-04T15:00:00Z\"}","relevance":2},{"id":658,"kind":"lesson","content":"GENESIS MAX v2 rassemble les souvenirs structurés disponibles dans le contexte de ChatGPT, les résumés de conversations récentes, la chronologie MELITURGOS et un index de documents retrouvés dans la Library. Il ne constitue pas une exportation mot à mot de l''intégralité des conversations de tout le compte ChatGPT.","importance":1,"confidence":0.5,"created_at":1788530855488,"valid_from":null,"valid_until":null,"source":"import","provenance":"","metadata":"{\"genesis_version\":\"2.0-max-accessible\",\"source\":\"accessible_chat_context_and_library_index\",\"sensitivity\":\"normal\",\"topic\":\"genesis\",\"date\":\"2026-09-04\",\"deduplicated_from\":[658],\"deduplicated_at\":\"2026-09-04T15:00:00Z\"}","relevance":1},{"id":20,"kind":"project","content":"MELITURGOS Cloud v0.2.1 a été déployé sur Cloudflare Workers le 4 septembre 2026.","importance":1,"confidence":0.5,"created_at":1788530505889,"valid_from":null,"valid_until":null,"source":"import","provenance":"","metadata":"{\"genesis_version\":\"1.0\",\"source\":\"shared_chat_history\",\"sensitivity\":\"normal\",\"topic\":\"meliturgos_cloud\",\"date\":\"2026-09-04\",\"deduplicated_from\":[20,103,186,271,308,340,513],\"deduplicated_at\":\"2026-09-04T15:00:00Z\"}","relevance":1},{"id":5,"kind":"identity","content":"MELITURGOS est conçu comme une IA personnelle persistante liée à Adrien, avec sa propre mémoire, son historique de travail, ses compétences et une continuité indépendante du modèle de langage utilisé comme moteur.","importance":1,"confidence":0.5,"created_at":1788530505058,"valid_from":null,"valid_until":null,"source":"import","provenance":"","metadata":"{\"genesis_version\":\"1.0\",\"source\":\"shared_chat_history\",\"sensitivity\":\"normal\",\"topic\":\"meliturgos\",\"deduplicated_from\":[5,88,171,255,272,294,472],\"deduplicated_at\":\"2026-09-04T15:00:00Z\"}","relevance":1},{"id":4,"kind":"identity","content":"Le nom de l''IA personnelle est MELITURGOS. Le nom a été choisi avec Adrien comme référence savante à la famille lexicale grecque/latine liée au travail du miel et au ''méliturge''.","importance":1,"confidence":0.5,"created_at":1788530505007,"valid_from":null,"valid_until":null,"source":"import","provenance":"","metadata":"{\"genesis_version\":\"1.0\",\"source\":\"shared_chat_history\",\"sensitivity\":\"normal\",\"topic\":\"meliturgos\",\"deduplicated_from\":[4,87,170,254,270,290,469],\"deduplicated_at\":\"2026-09-04T15:00:00Z\"}","relevance":1},{"id":603,"kind":"fact","content":"La base D1 porte le nom ''meliturgos-memory''.","importance":0.99,"confidence":0.5,"created_at":1788530852965,"valid_from":null,"valid_until":null,"source":"import","provenance":"","metadata":"{\"genesis_version\":\"2.0-max-accessible\",\"source\":\"accessible_chat_context_and_library_index\",\"sensitivity\":\"normal\",\"topic\":\"meliturgos_cloud\",\"date\":\"2026-09-04\",\"deduplicated_from\":[603],\"deduplicated_at\":\"2026-09-04T15:00:00Z\"}","relevance":1},{"id":592,"kind":"decision","content":"MELITURGOS doit conserver un modèle stable de référence et tester toute version candidate avant promotion, avec possibilité de rollback.","importance":0.99,"confidence":0.5,"created_at":1788530852495,"valid_from":null,"valid_until":null,"source":"import","provenance":"","metadata":"{\"genesis_version\":\"2.0-max-accessible\",\"source\":\"accessible_chat_context_and_library_index\",\"sensitivity\":\"normal\",\"topic\":\"self_improvement\",\"date\":\"2026-09-04\",\"deduplicated_from\":[592],\"deduplicated_at\":\"2026-09-04T15:00:00Z\"}","relevance":1},{"id":23,"kind":"fact","content":"Le cerveau cloud de MELITURGOS utilise Cloudflare Workers AI via un binding nommé AI.","importance":0.99,"confidence":0.5,"created_at":1788530506030,"valid_from":null,"valid_until":null,"source":"import","provenance":"","